{"page":249,"verses":[{"verse_key":"13:1","surah":13,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" الٓمٓر ۚ تِلْكَ ءَايَـٰتُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ۗ وَٱلَّذِىٓ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْكَ مِن رَّبِّكَ ٱلْحَقُّ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Alif Lam Mim Ra These are the signs of the Scripture. What your Lord has sent down to you [Prophet] is the truth, yet most people do not believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"الٓمٓر ۚ","en_gloss":"Alif Laam Mim Ra","transliteration":"alif-lam-meem-ra","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تِلْكَ","en_gloss":"These","transliteration":"til'ka","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"(are) the Verses","transliteration":"āyātu","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"And that which","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"has been revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَّبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"most","transliteration":"akthara","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(of) the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"13:1"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:1"}]},{"verse_key":"13:2","surah":13,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى رَفَعَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ بِغَيْرِ عَمَدٍ تَرَوْنَهَا ۖ ثُمَّ ٱسْتَوَىٰ عَلَى ٱلْعَرْشِ ۖ وَسَخَّرَ ٱلشَّمْسَ وَٱلْقَمَرَ ۖ كُلٌّ يَجْرِى لِأَجَلٍ مُّسَمًّى ۚ يُدَبِّرُ ٱلْأَمْرَ يُفَصِّلُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لَعَلَّكُم بِلِقَآءِ رَبِّكُمْ تُوقِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is God who raised up the heavens with no visible supports and then established Himself on the throne; He has subjected the sun and the moon each to pursue its course for an appointed time; He regulates all things, and makes the revelations clear so that you may be certain of meeting your Lord;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَفَعَ","en_gloss":"raised","transliteration":"rafaʿa","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَمَدٍۢ","en_gloss":"pillars","transliteration":"ʿamadin","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَرَوْنَهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"that you see","transliteration":"tarawnahā","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ","en_gloss":"He established","transliteration":"is'tawā","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Throne","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَسَخَّرَ","en_gloss":"and subjected","transliteration":"wasakhara","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","en_gloss":"the sun","transliteration":"l-shamsa","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the moon","transliteration":"wal-qamara","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كُلٌّۭ","en_gloss":"each","transliteration":"kullun","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَجْرِى","en_gloss":"running","transliteration":"yajrī","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لِأَجَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a term","transliteration":"li-ajalin","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۚ","en_gloss":"appointed","transliteration":"musamman","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يُدَبِّرُ","en_gloss":"He arranges","transliteration":"yudabbiru","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرَ","en_gloss":"the matter","transliteration":"l-amra","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يُفَصِّلُ","en_gloss":"He details","transliteration":"yufaṣṣilu","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Signs","transliteration":"l-āyāti","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":23,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُم","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِلِقَآءِ","en_gloss":"in the meeting","transliteration":"biliqāi","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":25,"ar":"رَبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"(with) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":26,"ar":"تُوقِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe with certainty","transliteration":"tūqinūna","verse_key":"13:2"},{"pos":27,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:2"}]},{"verse_key":"13:3","surah":13,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى مَدَّ ٱلْأَرْضَ وَجَعَلَ فِيهَا رَوَٰسِىَ وَأَنْهَـٰرًا ۖ وَمِن كُلِّ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ جَعَلَ فِيهَا زَوْجَيْنِ ٱثْنَيْنِ ۖ يُغْشِى ٱلَّيْلَ ٱلنَّهَارَ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"it is He who spread out the earth, placed firm mountains and rivers on it, and made two of every kind of fruit; He draws the veil of night over the day. There truly are signs in this for people who reflect.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَدَّ","en_gloss":"spread","transliteration":"madda","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"and placed","transliteration":"wajaʿala","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَوَٰسِىَ","en_gloss":"firm mountains","transliteration":"rawāsiya","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنْهَـٰرًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"and rivers","transliteration":"wa-anhāran","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمِن","en_gloss":"and from","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the fruits","transliteration":"l-thamarāti","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"He made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":14,"ar":"زَوْجَيْنِ","en_gloss":"pairs","transliteration":"zawjayni","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱثْنَيْنِ ۖ","en_gloss":"two","transliteration":"ith'nayni","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُغْشِى","en_gloss":"He covers","transliteration":"yugh'shī","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(with) the day","transliteration":"l-nahāra","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":22,"ar":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"surely (are) Signs","transliteration":"laāyātin","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":23,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"who ponder","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","verse_key":"13:3"},{"pos":25,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:3"}]},{"verse_key":"13:4","surah":13,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"وَفِى ٱلْأَرْضِ قِطَعٌ مُّتَجَـٰوِرَٰتٌ وَجَنَّـٰتٌ مِّنْ أَعْنَـٰبٍ وَزَرْعٌ وَنَخِيلٌ صِنْوَانٌ وَغَيْرُ صِنْوَانٍ يُسْقَىٰ بِمَآءٍ وَٰحِدٍ وَنُفَضِّلُ بَعْضَهَا عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ فِى ٱلْأُكُلِ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There are, in the land, neighbouring plots, gardens of vineyards, cornfields, palm trees in clusters or otherwise, all watered with the same water, yet We make some of them taste better than others: there truly are signs in this for people who reason.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَفِى","en_gloss":"And in","transliteration":"wafī","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قِطَعٌۭ","en_gloss":"are tracks","transliteration":"qiṭaʿun","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُّتَجَـٰوِرَٰتٌۭ","en_gloss":"neighboring","transliteration":"mutajāwirātun","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَجَنَّـٰتٌۭ","en_gloss":"and gardens","transliteration":"wajannātun","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَعْنَـٰبٍۢ","en_gloss":"grapevines","transliteration":"aʿnābin","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَزَرْعٌۭ","en_gloss":"and crops","transliteration":"wazarʿun","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَنَخِيلٌۭ","en_gloss":"and date-palms","transliteration":"wanakhīlun","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"صِنْوَانٌۭ","en_gloss":"trees (growing) from a single root","transliteration":"ṣin'wānun","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَغَيْرُ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"waghayru","verse_key":"13:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"صِنْوَانٍۢ","en_gloss":"trees (growing) from a single root","transliteration":"ṣin'wānin","verse_key":"13:4"}